OL,3,GNEWSAFarewell to cross-Channel ferry
OL,4,Aafter three decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrittany Ferries' Barfleur sails out of
OL,7,FPoole for the final time after more
OL,8,Fthan 30 years on the cross-Channel
OL,9,Froute to Cherbourg
OL,11,FThe operator has blamed high costs and
OL,12,Ffalling passenger numbers for the
OL,13,Fdecision to end the route and sell the
OL,14,Fvessel
OL,16,FPeople are expected to gather on the
OL,17,Fshoreline and on small boats to say
OL,18,Ffarewell
OL,20,FThe ferry is scheduled to cast off its
OL,21,Fmoorings at Poole's ferry terminal at
OL,22,F08:30 BST
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
